	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Bring a map, food and an empty loot bag. Mark the portal immediately; the forest's progression protects later regions until bosses are defeated."
				"Twilight Forest progression is advancement-gated. If an area inflicts a strange effect or blocks interaction, open the Twilight advancements and defeat the required earlier encounter rather than trying to bypass the biome."
				"The Twilight Road is a sequence, not a checklist race. The Chronicle asks the team to name each lodge and record one lesson from every boss so the forest becomes a travelled country."
				"Enter each boss region with a bed or return point outside, spare food, blocks, ranged options, and room for loot. Secure the retreat before crossing the arena boundary."
			]
			id: "671F69D7D0ACA1E3"
			rewards: [{
