				"Enter each boss region with a bed or return point outside, spare food, blocks, ranged options, and room for loot. Secure the retreat before crossing the arena boundary."
				"Many structures contain unique blocks, plants, food, and materials beyond the boss reward. Survey after victory, take renewable samples, and preserve enough of the site that later players can understand what happened there."
