		{
			description: [
				"Twilight Forest uses ordered progression. Acid rain, darkness, barriers or other hostile effects usually mean the previous boss or achievement has not been completed."
				"Use the Magic Map, read advancements and clear lairs deliberately instead of forcing entry into a protected biome. Keep trophies and unique drops until their purpose is known."
				"The forest is less a maze than an argument: prove you understand one region before the next accepts you."
				"Twilight Forest progression is advancement-gated. If an area inflicts a strange effect or blocks interaction, open the Twilight advancements and defeat the required earlier encounter rather than trying to bypass the biome."
			]
			id: "667A4E8069400A5F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "51AA54D03D400BFA"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
