			}]
			title: "Hollow Hills, Hedge Mazes and the Questing Ram"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0BBE00E205F4C8A7"]
			description: [
				"The swamp branch runs through Labyrinth and Minoshroom to the Hydra. The dark forest branch runs through the Knightly Stronghold to the Ur-Ghast. The snowy branch runs through Alpha Yeti to Snow Queen."
				"These branches can be divided among prepared teams, but progression items and trophies should return to the shared archive."
				"The Highlands expects the important victories from all three branches. If the final region rejects you, compare advancements before repeating bosses at random."
				"Twilight Forest progression is advancement-gated. If an area inflicts a strange effect or blocks interaction, open the Twilight advancements and defeat the required earlier encounter rather than trying to bypass the biome."
			]
			id: "354FDC9D29BACA34"
