		{
			dependencies: ["354FDC9D29BACA34"]
			description: [
				"In the Highlands, Troll Caves lead to magic beans and giant-scale resources. The Lamp of Cinders clears the thorn barrier toward the final plateau."
				"Prepare vertical travel and storage before climbing to cloud cottages or carrying giant materials. Mark the route back through the cave and thornlands."
				"The Final Castle remains an atmospheric culmination rather than a conventional finished final boss. Treat reaching it, documenting it and returning together as the victory."
				"Craft and use the Magic Map to read major landmarks. Build a labelled portal lodge, mark cleared structures, and keep trophies because progression and later objectives may depend on proof of earlier victories."
			]
